Below 4 rows per expert, the sorted fp expert gather's mat-vec (row_dot_sorted_kernel) loads each
expert's weight row once per run of sorted rows on that expert instead of once per row. Each
output keeps row_dot's per-row arithmetic at the threads per row the per-row launch picks, so it
is bit-identical to the per-row mat-vec.

Retires with mlx-cuda-row-dot-matvec.patch, or when upstream's gather mat-vec shares weight loads
across sorted rows. Not reported upstream yet.

